{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T19:43:02.564Z","ordinal":21610,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019febe2-4640-7603-85dc-6a0600b762b0","turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"item-1176","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The completed reviewers added six valid threads across three deeper lifecycle issues: compensation intent must be durable before return, push must separate precommit from post-commit reconciliation failures, and outer transactions must never publish through an unsettled transaction adapter. I’m stopping the obsolete check wait and addressing these as one settlement redesign with targeted regressions."}],"phase":"commentary"},"completed_at_ms":1787254982564}}
