{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T19:45:31.163Z","ordinal":21701,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019febe2-4640-7603-85dc-6a0600b762b0","turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"item-1180","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The complete DataFn gate is green again: 961 passing, 1 skipped, plus typecheck/build. Three reviewer claims are already covered by passing regression evidence and current control flow—transactional outbox enqueue is inside the same transaction, post-commit drains are caught before success recording, and outer share rollback has zero directory writes. I’m committing the valid durability/settlement fixes, then I’ll reply to all six threads with either the fix or the exact existing proof."}],"phase":"commentary"},"completed_at_ms":1787255131163}}
