tory grant when the database transaction rolls back\n ✓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > does not publish a failed nontransactional dual-write share 11ms\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > restores a directory grant when a direct unshare transaction rolls back\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > does not invalidate a direct unshare when repair persistence is unavailable\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > durably retries a committed share when directory indexing fails\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > does not let a delayed share retry recreate a concurrently revoked grant\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > does not let an older retry overwrite a newer grant level\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > backs off failed outbox tasks so newer grants are not starved\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > does not let the interval drain consume a pre-commit directory task\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > renews a pre-commit lease for operations longer than the recovery window\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > fences an in-flight lease renewal when publishing readiness\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > reports ownership loss without writing through the caller adapter\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 mutation semantics > stops a pending lease before a failing explicit drain lookup\n ↓ src/execution/mutation/__tests__/share-spv2.test.ts > share SPV2 m