{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T20:00:42.035Z","ordinal":22016,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_077ca705e7ea3749016a875ce43d74819186ef12c23be12d74","status":"completed","call_id":"call_CPF72W6hg3nGPKQOACfAih7c","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd: \"GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh api graphql -F REDACTED -f body='Fixed in 6c4428bd. Direct mutation and push failure paths now check the discard result; when ownership is lost they persist replacement reconciliation with fail-closed durable enqueue, then reconcile against the rolled-back authoritative grant state. The direct regression deliberately publishes the partial grant, simulates another owner deleting the leased task while discard returns false, and verifies the directory and outbox both end empty.' -f query='mutation($threadId:ID!,$body:String!){addPullRequestReviewThreadReply(input:{pullRequestReviewThreadId:$threadId,body:$body}){comment{id url}}}' && GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh api graphql -F REDACTED -f query='mutation($threadId:ID!){resolveReviewThread(input:{threadId:$threadId}){thread{id isResolved}}}' && GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh api graphql -F threadId=REDACTED -f body='Fixed in 6c4428bd. Failed-share settlement remains fail-closed, but all persistence/read/delete retry loops now use capped exponential backoff (50 ms, 100 ms, doubling to a 5 s cap) instead of polling every 25 ms. The timer regression verifies the first two retry intervals.' -f query='mutation($threadId:ID!,$body:String!){addPullRequestReviewThreadReply(input:{pullRequestReviewThreadId:$threadId,body:$body}){comment{id url}}}' && GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh api graphql -F threadId=REDACTED -f query='mutation($threadId:ID!){resolveReviewThread(input:{threadId:$threadId}){thread{id isResolved}}}'\",\n  workdir: \"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/worktrees/superfunctions/review-followup-dev-2026-08-20\",\n  yield_time_ms: 30000,\n  max_output_tokens: 12000\n});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","create_time":1787256033.903182}}}
