{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T20:23:36.751Z","ordinal":22298,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_077ca705e7ea3749016a876245b7508191b81d36a0f32d924e","status":"completed","call_id":"call_WVq7KkyLK67XOrDcA4d21Zde","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd: \"GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh api graphql --paginate -F owner=21nCo -F name=super-functions -F number=115 -f query='query($owner:String!,$name:String!,$number:Int!,$endCursor:String){repository(owner:$owner,name:$name){pullRequest(number:$number){headRefOid reviewThreads(first:100,after:$endCursor){nodes{id isResolved path line comments(first:30){nodes{author{login} body url createdAt}}}pageInfo{hasNextPage endCursor}}}}}' | jq -s '{head: .[0].data.repository.pullRequest.headRefOid, total: ([.[].data.repository.pullRequest.reviewThreads.nodes[]] | length), unresolved: [.[].data.repository.pullRequest.reviewThreads.nodes[] | select(.isResolved == false) | {id,path,line,comments}]}'\",\n  workdir: \"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/worktrees/superfunctions/review-followup-dev-2026-08-20\",\n  yield_time_ms: 30000,\n  max_output_tokens: 30000\n});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","create_time":1787257411.717627}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T20:23:40.591Z","ordinal":22299,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a020d7-fb2f-7560-863a-9884bdebce1d","call_id":"call_WVq7KkyLK67XOrDcA4d21Zde","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.8 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\n  \"head\": \"6c4428bd5b5502cbc5b16f33c68985406da996c8\",\n  \"total\": 220,\n  \"unresolved\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6a8dV5\",\n      \"path\": \"packages/cli/src/utils/schema-diff.ts\",\n      \"line\": 489,\n      \"comments\": {\n        \"nodes\": [\n          {\n            \"author\": {\n              \"login\": \"greptile-apps\"\n            },\n            \"body\": \"<a href=\\\"#\\\"><img alt=\\\"P1\\\" src=\\\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\\\" align=\\\"top\\\"></a> **Foreign-key composite indexes are rebuilt unsafely**\\n\\nWhen a MySQL composite index supports a foreign key through its leading columns and a later indexed column changes type or width, this rebuild selection includes the supporting index without applying the existing foreign-key guard. The generated migration drops that index while the foreign key remains active, which MySQL rejects. Reject these rebuilds when the current index starts with local or inbound foreign-key columns, or require an explicit migration that recreates the foreign key around the index change.\\n\\n<sub><a href=\\\"https://www.greptile.com/trex\\\"><img alt=\\\"T-Rex\\\" src=\\\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/trex/trex_green.svg\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" align=\\\"absmiddle\\\"></a> Ran code and verified through T-Rex</sub>\\n\\n<details><summary>Prompt To Fix With AI</summary>\\n\\n`````markdown\\nThis is a comment left during a code review.\\nPath: packages/cli/src/utils/schema-diff.ts\\nLine: 481-489\\n\\nComment:\\n**Foreign-key composite indexes are rebuilt unsafely**\\n\\nWhen a MySQL composite index supports a foreign key through its leading columns and a later indexed column changes type or width, this rebuild selection includes the supporting index without applying the existing foreign-key guard. The generated migration drops that index while the foreign key remains active, which MySQL rejects. Reject these rebuilds when the current index starts with local or inbound foreign-key columns, or require an explicit migration that recreates the foreign key around the index change.\\n\\n---\\n\\nFor each issue above, determine whether it is valid and should be fixed. If so, fix it directly.\\n`````\\n</details>\",\n            \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/115#discussion_r3824980728\",\n            \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-20T20:09:37Z\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","create_time":1787257420.591702}}}
