{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T20:56:24.412Z","ordinal":22846,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019febe2-4640-7603-85dc-6a0600b762b0","turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"item-1239","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The AuthFn failures are narrowed to two branch-integration defects, not runtime regressions: a pre-existing `next` test imports the API-key plugin from AuthFn core even though that plugin is a separate package, and Social OAuth inherits `next`’s docs-only root Vitest project because it lacks a local config. I’m correcting those package-local test boundaries and rerunning the affected gates."}],"phase":"commentary"},"completed_at_ms":1787259384412}}
