 Call `pullfrog_select_mode` with the appropriate mode name. This returns **your workflow** — a step-by-step playbook you must follow.\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8562058Z \npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8563535Z **Work through the returned steps in order.** It is the house playbook for this kind of task and it encodes what usually matters. Where the task in front of you genuinely calls for something better, do that instead and say why in your final summary.\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8565226Z \npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8565563Z Available modes:\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8566975Z - \"Build\": Implement, build, create, or develop code changes; make specific changes to files or features; execute a plan; or handle tasks with specific implementation details\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8569450Z - \"AddressReviews\": Address PR review feedback; respond to reviewer comments; make requested changes to an existing PR\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8571207Z - \"Review\": Review code, PRs, or implementations; provide feedback or suggestions; identify issues; or check code quality, style, and correctness\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8573366Z - \"IncrementalReview\": Re-review a PR after new commits are pushed; focus on new changes since the last review\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8575044Z - \"Plan\": Create plans, break down tasks, outline steps, analyze requirements, understand scope of work, or provide task breakdowns\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8576430Z - \"Fix\": Fix CI failures; debug failing tests or builds; investigate and resolve check suite failures\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8578126Z - \"ResolveConflicts\": Resolve merge conflicts in a PR branch against the base branch\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:02:34.8579784Z - \"Task\": General-purpose tasks that don't fit other modes: answering questions, adding comments, 