{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T21:14:56.715Z","ordinal":23231,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019febe2-4640-7603-85dc-6a0600b762b0","turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"item-1259","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"A substantive late review thread just landed on DataFn push handling: failed transactional unshares can skip reconciliation if `recordMutationFailure()` throws first, leaving the external directory invalidated while the rolled-back grant remains. I’m fixing the ordering/finalization path now and will add focused coverage before replying and resolving the thread."}],"phase":"commentary"},"completed_at_ms":1787260496715}}
