ness\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6357565Z - \"IncrementalReview\": Re-review a PR after new commits are pushed; focus on new changes since the last review\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6359726Z - \"Plan\": Create plans, break down tasks, outline steps, analyze requirements, understand scope of work, or provide task breakdowns\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6361648Z - \"Fix\": Fix CI failures; debug failing tests or builds; investigate and resolve check suite failures\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6363416Z - \"ResolveConflicts\": Resolve merge conflicts in a PR branch against the base branch\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6365146Z - \"Task\": General-purpose tasks that don't fit other modes: answering questions, adding comments, labeling, running ad-hoc commands, or any direct request\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6366747Z \npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6367244Z ### Step 2: Execute\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6368033Z \npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6369175Z Follow the mode guidance to complete the task. Use your native file and shell tools for local operations, and the pullfrog MCP tools for GitHub/git operations.\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6371507Z \npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6371997Z ### No-action cases\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6372833Z \npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6373820Z If the task clearly requires no work, call `pullfrog_report_progress` directly to explain why no action is needed.\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6375280Z \npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6376357Z Eagerly inspect the MCP tools available to you via the `pullfrog` MCP server. These are VITALLY IMPORTANT to completing your task.\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6377912Z \npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19:27.6378481Z ************* EVENT CONTEXT *************\npullfrog\tRun agent\t2026-08-20T21:19: