{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T22:03:35.778Z","ordinal":24125,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_077ca705e7ea3749016a8779b4b1d88191aa015b08982af93d","status":"completed","call_id":"call_wPecCUyQFkNGTVL59BkdmRrh","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd: \"GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh api graphql --paginate -F owner=21nCo -F name=super-functions.next -F number=46 -f query='query($owner:String!,$name:String!,$number:Int!,$endCursor:String){repository(owner:$owner,name:$name){pullRequest(number:$number){headRefOid reviewThreads(first:100,after:$endCursor){nodes{id isResolved path line comments(first:20){nodes{author{login} body url createdAt}}}pageInfo{hasNextPage endCursor}}}}}' | jq -s '{head: .[0].data.repository.pullRequest.headRefOid, total: ([.[].data.repository.pullRequest.reviewThreads.nodes[]] | length), unresolved: [.[].data.repository.pullRequest.reviewThreads.nodes[] | select(.isResolved == false) | {id,path,line,comments}]}'\",\n  workdir: \"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/worktrees/superfunctions/review-followup-next-2026-08-20\",\n  yield_time_ms: 30000,\n  max_output_tokens: 16000\n});\ntext(r.output);","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","create_time":1787263411.53793}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T22:03:36.669Z","ordinal":24126,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a02133-795d-72e1-8825-4294229eab5f","call_id":"call_wPecCUyQFkNGTVL59BkdmRrh","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.9 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\n  \"head\": \"a536b8db9ae526ceb959ac1e39ee016ec8f8b500\",\n  \"total\": 14,\n  \"unresolved\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"PRRT_kwDOQ4ERBM6a-RG_\",\n      \"path\": \"plugfn/core/src/schema.ts\",\n      \"line\": null,\n      \"comments\": {\n        \"nodes\": [\n          {\n            \"author\": {\n              \"login\": \"chatgpt-codex-connector\"\n            },\n            \"body\": \"**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Allow legacy claim tokens through the v7 migration**\\n\\nWhen upgrading a MySQL installation from v6, this `maxLength` change converts the existing `TEXT` column to `VARCHAR(64)`. The v6 queue claimer stored `${workerId}:${job.id}:${timestamp}`; even the default generated worker and job IDs produce roughly 66 characters, and caller-provided worker IDs can make it longer. Consequently, an active or stale claimed job can make the generated `ALTER TABLE ... MODIFY COLUMN` fail with “Data too long” (or truncate under permissive SQL modes), blocking or corrupting the v7 migration. Retain a width that accommodates legacy tokens or explicitly transform/clear them before narrowing the column.\\n\\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/46#discussion_r3825689787\",\n            \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-20T21:59:55Z\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"PRRT_kwDOQ4ERBM6a-RHG\",\n      \"path\": \"plugfn/core/src/schema.ts\",\n      \"line\": 11,\n      \"comments\": {\n        \"nodes\": [\n          {\n            \"author\": {\n              \"login\": \"chatgpt-codex-connector\"\n            },\n            \"body\": \"**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Update the published schema-version metadata**\\n\\nBumping `PLUGFN_SCHEMA_VERSION` to 7 leaves `plugfn/core/package.json` at `superfunctions.schemaVersion: 6`. `discoverSuperfunctionsPackages()` reads and exposes that package metadata, so installed PlugFn packages are still reported as requiring schema version 6 even though `getSchema()` now returns version 7; consumers using discovery metadata to determine required migrations will miss this schema upgrade. Update the package metadata alongside this constant.\\n\\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/46#discussion_r3825689795\",\n            \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-20T21:59:56Z\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","create_time":1787263416.669493}}}
