{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T22:14:53.909Z","ordinal":24269,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a0213d-ced4-7302-b138-bbf6602bbb22","call_id":"call_Ieq0CvspJ9mQqDLvBcn3POC4","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"## codex/review-followup-next-2026-08-20...sf-next/codex/review-followup-next-2026-08-20\nlocal_head=a536b8db9ae526ceb959ac1e39ee016ec8f8b500\nremote_next=291942c0ed2af6df932df57a75a2c7d7412e2e3b\n{\n  \"state\": \"OPEN\",\n  \"mergeable\": \"MERGEABLE\",\n  \"mergeStateStatus\": \"UNSTABLE\",\n  \"headRefOid\": \"a536b8db9ae526ceb959ac1e39ee016ec8f8b500\",\n  \"baseRefOid\": \"291942c0ed2af6df932df57a75a2c7d7412e2e3b\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/46\",\n  \"checks\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"guardrails\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"FAILURE\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Plan\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"SUCCESS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"mailfn-release\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"SUCCESS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"JavaScript\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"FAILURE\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Python\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"SKIPPED\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"McpFn release gate\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"SUCCESS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Docs Guardrails\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"SKIPPED\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Vercel – super-functions-datafn-docs\",\n      \"status\": null,\n      \"state\": \"FAILURE\",\n      \"conclusion\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Vercel – super-functions-hostfn-docs\",\n      \"status\": null,\n      \"state\": \"FAILURE\",\n      \"conclusion\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Vercel – super-functions-searchfn-docs\",\n      \"status\": null,\n      \"state\": \"FAILURE\",\n      \"conclusion\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"pullfrog\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"FAILURE\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Graphite / AI Reviews\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"SKIPPED\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"CodeRabbit\",\n      \"status\": null,\n      \"state\": \"SUCCESS\",\n      \"conclusion\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"GitGuardian Security Checks\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"SUCCESS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Socket Security: Project Report\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"SUCCESS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Socket Security: Pull Request Alerts\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": \"SUCCESS\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n{\n  \"head\": \"a536b8db9ae526ceb959ac1e39ee016ec8f8b500\",\n  \"total\": 15,\n  \"unresolved\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"PRRT_kwDOQ4ERBM6a-acG\",\n      \"path\": \"datafn/swift-bridge/src/nativeSyncController.ts\",\n      \"line\": 56,\n      \"comments\": {\n        \"nodes\": [\n          {\n            \"author\": {\n              \"login\": \"chatgpt-codex-connector\"\n            },\n            \"body\": \"**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve capabilities while another handshake is pending**\\n\\nWhen multiple native clients/controllers share a bridge bus, starting a second handshake immediately replaces the bus-wide capability set with an empty set. The first client’s initialization promise is already settled, so a concurrent missing-record merge observes `atomicMergeIfMissing` as false and omits the `ifMissing` creation payload, losing schema defaults and create-only audit/timestamp fields; a failed second handshake leaves this degradation permanent. Keep the last successful capability set until the new handshake succeeds, or gate storage operations while renegotiation is active.\\n\\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/46#discussion_r3825748048\",\n            \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-20T22:10:35Z\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","create_time":1787264093.908991}}}
