{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T22:16:00.601Z","ordinal":24309,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_077ca705e7ea3749016a877c9c12248191877ef195a90ff1ae","status":"completed","call_id":"call_Hx9QC0LE7FvV8pwqcAXCByXO","name":"exec","input":"const reply = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd: \"GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh api graphql -f query='mutation($threadId:ID!,$body:String!){addPullRequestReviewThreadReply(input:{pullRequestReviewThreadId:$threadId,body:$body}){comment{id url}}}' -F REDACTED -f body=\\\"Fixed in 478aa685. Starting a new bus-wide capability negotiation now advances the generation fence while preserving the last successfully negotiated set. A successful latest handshake still replaces the set, stale overlapping responses remain ignored, and a pending or failed replacement handshake no longer degrades already initialized storage clients. The new regression covers both the pending and failed replacement states; all 30 Swift bridge tests, type-check, and build pass.\\\"\",\n  workdir: \"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/worktrees/superfunctions/review-followup-next-2026-08-20\",\n  yield_time_ms: 30000,\n  max_output_tokens: 4000\n});\ntext(reply.output);\nif (reply.exit_code !== 0) exit();\nconst resolve = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd: \"GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh api graphql -f query='mutation($threadId:ID!){resolveReviewThread(input:{threadId:$threadId}){thread{id isResolved}}}' -F REDACTED\",\n  workdir: \"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/worktrees/superfunctions/review-followup-next-2026-08-20\",\n  yield_time_ms: 30000,\n  max_output_tokens: 4000\n});\ntext(resolve.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","create_time":1787264155.346018}}}
