{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T23:04:39.254Z","ordinal":24963,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_077ca705e7ea3749016a878803b6a08191ba7a06f439157955","status":"completed","call_id":"call_FSgXDPlHhm4jQyjSacaAprqb","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\"cmd\":\"git fetch origin dev && git fetch sf-next next && local_head=$(git rev-parse HEAD) && origin_dev=$(git rev-parse origin/dev) && next_head=$(git rev-parse sf-next/next) && printf 'local_head=%s\\\\norigin_dev=%s\\\\nnext_head=%s\\\\n' \\\"$local_head\\\" \\\"$origin_dev\\\" \\\"$next_head\\\" && if git merge-base --is-ancestor \\\"$origin_dev\\\" \\\"$local_head\\\"; then echo 'origin_dev_in_pr=yes'; else echo 'origin_dev_in_pr=no'; fi && GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh pr view 46 --repo 21nCo/super-functions.next --json state,headRefOid,baseRefName,mergeStateStatus,isDraft,url && GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh api graphql --paginate -F owner=21nCo -F name=super-functions.next -F number=46 -f query='query($owner:String!,$name:String!,$number:Int!,$endCursor:String){repository(owner:$owner,name:$name){pullRequest(number:$number){headRefOid baseRefOid reviewThreads(first:100,after:$endCursor){nodes{id isResolved path line comments(first:20){nodes{author{login} body url createdAt}}}pageInfo{hasNextPage endCursor}}}}}' | jq -s '{head: .[0].data.repository.pullRequest.headRefOid, base: .[0].data.repository.pullRequest.baseRefOid, total: ([.[].data.repository.pullRequest.reviewThreads.nodes[]] | length), unresolved: [.[].data.repository.pullRequest.reviewThreads.nodes[] | select(.isResolved == false) | {id,path,line,comments}]}'\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/worktrees/superfunctions/review-followup-next-2026-08-20\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":30000});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","create_time":1787267068.398617}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T23:04:42.750Z","ordinal":24964,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a0216b-69fe-7e02-9ece-abc6761add58","call_id":"call_FSgXDPlHhm4jQyjSacaAprqb","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"From https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions\n * branch              dev        -> FETCH_HEAD\nFrom https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next\n * branch              next       -> FETCH_HEAD\nlocal_head=2d64c9c499bffcc8d3a286169314a48647c36f0a\norigin_dev=72aabce915426325450663feffd7a53089ef4489\nnext_head=291942c0ed2af6df932df57a75a2c7d7412e2e3b\norigin_dev_in_pr=yes\n{\"baseRefName\":\"next\",\"headRefOid\":\"2d64c9c499bffcc8d3a286169314a48647c36f0a\",\"isDraft\":false,\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNSTABLE\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/46\"}\n{\n  \"head\": \"2d64c9c499bffcc8d3a286169314a48647c36f0a\",\n  \"base\": \"291942c0ed2af6df932df57a75a2c7d7412e2e3b\",\n  \"total\": 20,\n  \"unresolved\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"PRRT_kwDOQ4ERBM6a_Eh_\",\n      \"path\": \"datafn/core/src/schema.ts\",\n      \"line\": 576,\n      \"comments\": {\n        \"nodes\": [\n          {\n            \"author\": {\n              \"login\": \"chatgpt-codex-connector\"\n            },\n            \"body\": \"**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Validate foreignKey in Python too**\\n\\nWhen a shared runtime schema supplies a non-string legacy alias such as `foreignKey: 123`, this new TypeScript check rejects it, but `datafn/python/datafn/validation.py::validate_schema` only checks the relation endpoints and still returns success. `SchemaIndex` can then insert the non-string value into its field sets, so the same schema starts under Python but fails under TypeScript and produces unusable FK validation state; mirror this type check in the Python validator.\\n\\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L422-L422](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/blob/2d64c9c499bffcc8d3a286169314a48647c36f0a/AGENTS.md#L422-L422)\\n\\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/46#discussion_r3826009068\",\n            \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-20T23:02:04Z\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","create_time":1787267082.750944}}}
