{"timestamp":"2026-08-20T23:18:40.079Z","ordinal":25129,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019febe2-4640-7603-85dc-6a0600b762b0","turn_id":"01a01efc-6d32-70b2-a5a3-6d2475cf5417","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"item-1415","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Remote integration is complete. I stopped before processing the local changesets, as requested.\n\n- [PR #115](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/115) merged into `origin/dev`\n  - Reviewed head: `ef89fd60`\n  - Merge commit/current `origin/dev`: `72aabce9`\n  - 220/220 review threads resolved\n\n- [PR #46](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/46) merged into `sf-next/next`\n  - Reviewed head: `8e6fadc5`\n  - Merge commit/current `sf-next/next`: `194033fd`\n  - 20/20 review threads resolved\n  - Verified it contains current `origin/dev`\n\nValidation passed for the affected DataFn client and Python packages, MailFn, McpFn, planning, and security gates. Remaining failures were the previously identified unrelated ProbeFn cycle, SearchFn Ruff debt, guardrail policy, Pullfrog environment/auth, and Vercel plan restrictions.\n\nThe original changesets remain untouched:\n\n- Local `dev`: `713f82b3`, 377 unstaged and 71 untracked files\n- Preserved-next: `9cf38123`, 16 unstaged and 3 untracked files\n- No local changeset commits, pushes, or PRs were created\n- Clean integration worktree has zero pending changes\n\nThe next phase is now ready: inventory both dirty worktrees, group their changes logically, commit them on dedicated branches, and create unmerged PRs for review.\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":2993,"lineEnd":3015,"note":"used prior dirty dev worktree provenance to preserve the original integration stack while remediating current remote branches"}],"rolloutIds":["019fcc94-2243-7543-81c9-399c9871de91"]}},"completed_at_ms":1787267920079}}
