{"timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:39:53.501Z","ordinal":25231,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019febe2-4640-7603-85dc-6a0600b762b0","turn_id":"01a0229a-8394-7dc3-88d3-07bbf870a918","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"item-1426","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The dev replay has 115 overlaps because the snapshot and the now-reviewed remote independently changed the same AuthFn/DataFn/shared files. I’m preserving every cleanly applicable local hunk, using the reviewed remote side only inside overlapping conflict blocks, and separately checking deletion/rename cases. This is deliberately narrower than replacing whole files, so non-conflicting local work survives."}],"phase":"commentary"},"completed_at_ms":1787287193501}}
