{"timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:40:57.951Z","ordinal":25257,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019febe2-4640-7603-85dc-6a0600b762b0","turn_id":"01a0229a-8394-7dc3-88d3-07bbf870a918","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"item-1428","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The three-way replay reduced 472 source paths to only 18 residual diffs, confirming nearly all local work is already in `origin/dev`. Several residuals are clearly stale mid-refactor fragments—duplicate documentation blocks, invalid named-argument syntax in tests, and a duplicated reconcile helper—so I’m filtering those out rather than turning the snapshot into a regression. I’m reviewing the remaining runtime changes individually before deciding the commit groups."}],"phase":"commentary"},"completed_at_ms":1787287257951}}
