{"timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:42:09.421Z","ordinal":25288,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019febe2-4640-7603-85dc-6a0600b762b0","turn_id":"01a0229a-8394-7dc3-88d3-07bbf870a918","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"item-1430","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The remaining dev replay is not shippable: it creates an AuthFn dependency cycle, duplicates DataFn idempotency/reconcile functions, introduces invalid test syntax, re-adds pre-commit directory indexing that the reviewed outbox flow replaced, and restores an older rate-limit path superseded by CAS. I’m excluding those residuals. Since the exact original snapshot and dirty worktree remain preserved, nothing is lost; there is simply no good `dev` delta left to open as a PR."}],"phase":"commentary"},"completed_at_ms":1787287329421}}
