{"timestamp":"2026-08-21T05:02:27.512Z","ordinal":25440,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_077ca705e7ea3749016a87dbe0014c819199541bc9ffa3a407","status":"completed","call_id":"call_IOnxGgFJUvb5L8WrPBm92bB6","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh pr view 109 -R 21nCo/super-functions --json number,title,state,mergedAt,mergeCommit,headRefName,baseRefName,url && GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh pr view 114 -R 21nCo/super-functions --json number,title,state,mergedAt,mergeCommit,headRefName,baseRefName,url,body && GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh pr view 115 -R 21nCo/super-functions --json number,title,state,mergedAt,mergeCommit,headRefName,baseRefName,url\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/superfunctions\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":10000}); text(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a022b1-36ac-7732-bf2d-a946dee5da2c","create_time":1787288538.81062}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-21T05:02:29.327Z","ordinal":25441,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a022b2-f7cf-79b2-a8e4-b2ceaf972afc","call_id":"call_IOnxGgFJUvb5L8WrPBm92bB6","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.8 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"5d7420\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.637391458,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1298,\"output\":\"{\\\"baseRefName\\\":\\\"dev\\\",\\\"headRefName\\\":\\\"aravink/sf-41-production-readiness-shared-packages-d3fd\\\",\\\"mergeCommit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"7837ca636413cc50819e3481dd0e1f01b33d8e9e\\\"},\\\"mergedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-19T16:36:54Z\\\",\\\"number\\\":109,\\\"state\\\":\\\"MERGED\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Production readiness fixes across shared packages\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/109\\\"}\\n{\\\"baseRefName\\\":\\\"dev\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"## Summary\\\\n- integrate the latest local dev work across AuthFn, DataFn, FileFn, SearchFn, PlugFn, shared storage/observability, and the shared delivery contract\\\\n- preserve and reconcile the final merged state of PR #109, including DataFn transaction semantics and AuthFn modular schema discovery\\\\n- refresh package metadata, lockfile, generated API references, and CLI tests/docs to match the integrated behavior\\\\n- exclude local .conduct artifacts from the dev-targeted change set\\\\n\\\\n## Validation\\\\n- CI=true npm test: 168/168 tasks successful\\\\n- npx turbo run typecheck: 140/140 tasks successful\\\\n- npm run lint: 107/107 tasks successful; warnings only\\\\n- DataFn server: 902 passed, 1 skipped\\\\n- DataFn client: 611 passed\\\\n- DataFn CLI: 98 passed\\\\n- DataFn core: 333 passed\\\\n- git diff --check: clean\\\\n\\\\n## Reconciliation\\\\n- includes merge commit 7837ca63 from PR #109\\\\n- retains latest local runtime, temporal, relation, observability, and adapter changes while resolving stale test and documentation contracts\\\\n\\\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\\\\n---\\\\n## Summary by cubic\\\\nIntegrates a modular app/server runtime for `authfn`, adds shared observability and rate limiting, replaces “runtime” with “environment” resolution and endpoint, and shifts region lookup to atomic conditional KV. Old behavior: monolithic `@authfn/core` with `/auth/runtime` and record-style lookups; new behavior: `authfn(config).createServer(...)`, `/auth/environment`, instrumented DB/KV, optional rate limiting, and enforced durable rebuild boundaries.\\\\n\\\\n- Packages and API: rename `@authfn/core` to `authfn`; move bundled strategies to `@authfn/*` and declare with `authFnPlugins(...)`. Split app/server: `authfn({ namespace, plugins }).createServer({ database, stores, environment, pluginRuntime, hooks, observability, rateLimit })`. Normalize observability and instrument adapters; router adds observability middleware.\\\\n- Environment, not runtime: add `resolveEnvironment`/`mergeEnvironments`; expose `/auth/environment`. Client replaces `getRuntime()` with `getEnvironment()`.\\\\n- Multi‑region lookup and consistency: adopt `ConditionalKVStoreAdapter` (`get/set/setIfAbsent/compareAndSet/delete`) under keys `authfn:region:<identifier>` with optional TTL. Cloudflare DO stores raw values; DynamoDB supports `ttlAttributeName` (or `false`). Preserve distributed consistency via CAS.\\\\n- Router, middleware, and client: preserve query strings and AbortSignals; add local rate limit middleware with per‑category policies. Client adds `createTransportAuth` for cookie‑by‑default or bearer/header auth; regional client mirrors API.\\\\n- Admin/examples/docs: update imports to `authfn` subpaths and `@authfn/*`; refresh OpenAPI and docs.\\\\n\\\\n**Migration**\\\\n- Replace `@authfn/core` with `authfn` and install needed `@authfn/*` plugins; declare with `authFnPlugins(...)`.\\\\n- Replace `createAuthFn(config)` with:\\\\n  - `const app = authfn({ namespace, plugins: authFnPlugins(...plugins) })`\\\\n  - `const server = app.createServer({ database, stores, environment, pluginRuntime, hooks, observability, rateLimit })`\\\\n- Update clients to call `/auth/environment` and use `.getEnvironment()`; for non‑cookie auth use `.createTransportAuth({ bearerToken, headers, plugins })`.\\\\n- Migrate region lookup to conditional KV operations and the new key/value format; for DynamoDB set `ttlAttributeName` (or `false`).\\\\n- Emit events via `observability.events.emit({ domain: 'authfn', ... })` if you forward telemetry.\\\\n\\\\n<sup>Written for commit 11d1cc943e265a985029e2dee27f37406632bd78. Summary will update on new commits.</sup>\\\\n\\\\n<a href=\\\\\\\"https://cubic.dev/pr/21nCo/super-functions/pull/114?utm_source=github\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" rel=\\\\\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\\\\\" data-no-image-dialog=\\\\\\\"true\\\\\\\"><picture><source media=\\\\\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\\\\\" srcset=\\\\\\\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\\\\\\\"><source media=\\\\\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\\\\\" srcset=\\\\\\\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\\\\\\\"><img alt=\\\\\\\"Review in cubic\\\\\\\" src=\\\\\\\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\\\\\\\"></picture></a>\\\\n\\\\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"headRefName\\\":\\\"codex/dev-integration-2026-08-19\\\",\\\"mergeCommit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"dc1945253f7adc8376d0334477016af5551d1330\\\"},\\\"mergedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-19T19:44:00Z\\\",\\\"number\\\":114,\\\"state\\\":\\\"MERGED\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Integrate modular runtimes and shared observability into dev\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/114\\\"}\\n{\\\"baseRefName\\\":\\\"dev\\\",\\\"headRefName\\\":\\\"codex/review-followup-dev-2026-08-20\\\",\\\"mergeCommit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"72aabce915426325450663feffd7a53089ef4489\\\"},\\\"mergedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-20T20:48:27Z\\\",\\\"number\\\":115,\\\"state\\\":\\\"MERGED\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"fix: backport reviewed runtime safeguards\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/115\\\"}\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a022b1-36ac-7732-bf2d-a946dee5da2c","create_time":1787288549.327177}}}
