{"timestamp":"2026-08-21T06:17:01.534Z","ordinal":25776,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019febe2-4640-7603-85dc-6a0600b762b0","turn_id":"01a022f6-95e6-7513-9f41-02389adabfc4","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-0d77b30c-8027-400c-8060-7473ab97d7e8","server":"skillplane","tool":"skills_list","arguments":{"caller":{"agentId":"codex","agentName":"Codex","clientName":"Codex Desktop","clientVersion":"2026-08-21","conversationId":"superfunctions-publish-packages-2026-08-21","modelName":"GPT-5","modelProvider":"OpenAI","modelVersion":"GPT-5","runId":"superfunctions-publish-packages-2026-08-21","sessionId":"superfunctions-publish-packages-2026-08-21"},"workspace":{"slug":"21n"},"limit":100,"state":"active"},"readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"requestId\":\"mcp:7bf97f1c-51e2-4251-ade6-8b079f7c0534\",\"workspace\":{\"id\":\"workspace:cf0aa9c5-76c8-4a89-8a9b-66c70676c298\",\"slug\":\"21n\",\"name\":\"21n\",\"kind\":\"organization\"},\"skills\":[{\"id\":\"skill:2a3fc1af-e56d-47b9-9c91-615ee178c0a9\",\"workspaceId\":\"workspace:cf0aa9c5-76c8-4a89-8a9b-66c70676c298\",\"workspaceSlug\":\"21n\",\"slug\":\"publish-superfunctions-packages\",\"name\":\"Publish Superfunctions Packages\",\"summary\":\"Inventory, version, and publish a user-selected group of Superfunctions npm packages through a repository GitHub Actions tag workflow. Use for npm releases or publishing sprees that must release only packages changed since their relevant npm version, coordinate dependencies, choose stable or prerelease channels, and verify registry state.\",\"tags\":[\"github-actions\",\"npm\",\"release\",\"semver\",\"superfunctions\"],\"visibility\":\"workspace\",\"currentVersion\":{\"id\":\"skill-version:821dce48-509d-4265-ace8-5955c6d0b82d\",\"semanticVersion\":\"1.0.0\"},\"archivedAt\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-12T14:04:18.737Z\"},{\"id\":\"skill:b0758834-bb97-4ab8-b98c-83e9dcaf1375\",\"workspaceId\":\"workspace:cf0aa9c5-76c8-4a89-8a9b-66c70676c298\",\"workspaceSlug\":\"21n\",\"slug\":\"report-and-fix-pr\",\"name\":\"Report and Fix PR\",\"summary\":\"Generate a traceable GitHub pull request analysis report from automated review feedback, then fix every reported critical, medium, and low issue in the current worktree and return exact outcome statuses. Use when asked to analyze and remediate PR review feedback end to end, create a `.conduct/pr-reports` report before fixing, or combine PR reporting with PR fixes.\",\"tags\":[\"code-review\",\"github\",\"pull-request\",\"remediation\",\"reporting\"],\"visibility\":\"workspace\",\"currentVersion\":{\"id\":\"skill-version:3b214a47-904c-4fe7-b231-5a7c37743a05\",\"semanticVersion\":\"1.0.0\"},\"archivedAt\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-10T13:08:38.192Z\"},{\"id\":\"skill:2741acae-e541-436c-a656-3de9dbf99011\",\"workspaceId\":\"workspace:cf0aa9c5-76c8-4a89-8a9b-66c70676c298\",\"workspaceSlug\":\"21n\",\"slug\":\"work-linear-issue\",\"name\":\"Work Linear Issue\",\"summary\":\"Execute an existing Linear issue supplied by a master or orchestrating agent: read the complete issue and discussion, ask blocking clarifications, implement and verify locally, report completion on Linear, then only after explicit master approval create an exact issue-ID branch and open a pull request into the repository default branch.\",\"tags\":[\"approval-gate\",\"github\",\"implementation\",\"linear\",\"pull-request\"],\"visibility\":\"workspace\",\"currentVersion\":{\"id\":\"skill-version:46b773cb-4ad1-4c38-b585-38fae64154db\",\"semanticVersion\":\"1.0.1\"},\"archivedAt\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-05T16:06:00.809Z\"},{\"id\":\"skill:41ed749b-34dd-4137-b817-05461481b141\",\"workspaceId\":\"workspace:cf0aa9c5-76c8-4a89-8a9b-66c70676c298\",\"workspaceSlug\":\"21n\",\"slug\":\"post-update-on-slack\",\"name\":\"Post Update on Slack\",\"summary\":\"Post a concise update to the correct project Slack channel when the master explicitly requests it. Use when an agent is asked to post, send, or share a project update in Slack; if the master does not specify content, summarize the agent's latest substantive work or changes from the immediately preceding run, with verified status, links, blockers, and next steps.\",\"tags\":[\"communication\",\"project-update\",\"slack\",\"status-update\",\"verification\"],\"visibility\":\"workspace\",\"currentVersion\":{\"id\":\"skill-version:b0245312-4b0e-427b-a9ce-c910679a2f92\",\"semanticVersion\":\"1.0.0\"},\"archivedAt\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-05T10:50:49.405Z\"},{\"id\":\"skill:d30416c9-60db-4f92-af78-aff5b6f05693\",\"workspaceId\":\"workspace:cf0aa9c5-76c8-4a89-8a9b-66c70676c298\",\"workspaceSlug\":\"21n\",\"slug\":\"issue-fix\",\"name\":\"Issue Fix\",\"summary\":\"Troubleshoot and fix software issues with Linear-backed traceability. Use when a user asks an agent to investigate, debug, troubleshoot, repair, or fix a bug or incident, especially when the resulting change may be committed.\",\"tags\":[\"bug-fix\",\"git\",\"issue-tracking\",\"linear\",\"troubleshooting\"],\"visibility\":\"workspace\",\"currentVersion\":{\"id\":\"skill-version:5efca2a2-0ea5-4b92-ad6d-7ba77566f8b8\",\"semanticVersion\":\"1.2.0\"},\"archivedAt\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-04T13:31:31.676Z\"},{\"id\":\"skill:90f19177-bf30-4978-85d4-a783a2bd38a8\",\"workspaceId\":\"workspace:cf0aa9c5-76c8-4a89-8a9b-66c70676c298\",\"workspaceSlug\":\"21n\",\"slug\":\"add-to-backlog\",\"name\":\"Add to Backlog\",\"summary\":\"Capture an agent-thread discussion as a detailed Linear backlog item. Use when the user says add this to the backlog, capture this idea, create a Linear ticket, track this for later, or turn the current discussion into planned work requiring a relevant team, a backlog issue, and linked ideation and architecture documents.\",\"tags\":[\"architecture\",\"backlog\",\"documentation\",\"ideation\",\"linear\"],\"visibility\":\"workspace\",\"currentVersion\":{\"id\":\"skill-version:8727523e-56f8-4740-9f84-3bdf64f10387\",\"semanticVersion\":\"1.1.0\"},\"archivedAt\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-04T13:27:57.974Z\"},{\"id\":\"skill:e17145dd-c08c-4c38-b9a8-0dabff50c521\",\"workspaceId\":\"workspace:cf0aa9c5-76c8-4a89-8a9b-66c70676c298\",\"workspaceSlug\":\"21n\",\"slug\":\"create-and-associate-linear-issue\",\"name\":\"Create and Associate Linear Issue\",\"summary\":\"Resolve a Linear project and team, safely create or reuse an issue, associate documents, commits, pull requests, deployments, and other artifacts, recover partial writes, and verify the final state. Use as a shared dependency when another skill or agent workflow needs reliable Linear issue creation or association.\",\"tags\":[\"association\",\"composition\",\"issue-tracking\",\"linear\",\"verification\"],\"visibility\":\"workspace\",\"currentVersion\":{\"id\":\"skill-version:ed7287c6-932c-4ef6-800d-272086f5b407\",\"semanticVersion\":\"1.0.0\"},\"archivedAt\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-04T13:21:12.884Z\"}],\"nextCursor\":null}"}],"structuredContent":{"requestId":"mcp:7bf97f1c-51e2-4251-ade6-8b079f7c0534","workspace":{"id":"workspace:cf0aa9c5-76c8-4a89-8a9b-66c70676c298","slug":"21n","name":"21n","kind":"organization"},"skills":[{"id":"skill:2a3fc1af-e56d-47b9-9c91-615ee178c0a9","workspaceId":"workspace:cf0aa9c5-76c8-4a89-8a9b-66c70676c298","workspaceSlug":"21n","slug":"publish-superfunctions-packages","name":"Publish Superfunctions Packages","summary":"Inventory, version, and publish a user-selected group of Superfunctions npm packages through a repository GitHub Actions tag workflow. Use for npm releases or publishing sprees that must release only packages changed since their relevant npm version, coordinate dependencies, choose stable or prerelease channels, and verify registry state.","tags":["github-actions","npm","release","semver","superfunctions"],"visibility":"workspace","currentVersion":{"id":"skill-version:821dce48-509d-4265-ace8-5955c6d0b82d","semanticVersion":"1.0.0"},"archivedAt":null,"upda