{"timestamp":"2026-08-21T06:17:32.464Z","ordinal":25788,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a022f7-ae30-7900-b833-e15874a23eaf","call_id":"call_U0nZqqaxv9iyeERwOwnVjQux","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__skill_asset_retrieve\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nRetrieve one traversal-safe file from an exact authorized skill version. Small safe content is returned as UTF-8 or base64; larger files use a five-minute bearer-bound authenticated download.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__skill_asset_retrieve(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; path: string; responseMode?: \\\"auto\\\" | \\\"inline\\\" | \\\"download\\\"; skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; }; version: { selector: \\\"current\\\"; } | { selector: \\\"versionId\\\"; versionId: string; } | { selector: \\\"semanticVersion\\\"; semanticVersion: string; } | { revision: number; selector: \\\"revision\\\"; }; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ base64?: string; bundleDigest: string; byteSize: number; delivery: \\\"text\\\" | \\\"base64\\\" | \\\"authenticated_download\\\"; expiresAt?: string; mediaType: string; path: string; requestId: string; sha256: string; skillId: string; text?: string; url?: string; versionId: string; }>>; };\\n```\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a022f6-95e6-7513-9f41-02389adabfc4","create_time":1787293052.464081}}}
