n-style manual testing of Flux-to-DataFn/AuthFn migration work, wants root-cause fixes in shared packages, and needs honest validation boundaries when local browser/auth infrastructure is unhealthy. Boundaries: this memory covers browser-bootstrap blockers, account-service/Caddy preflight, focused regression coverage, and the exact environment blockers seen in this checkout; it is not a claim that full browser smoke succeeded.\\n4940-applies_to: cwd=/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/nucleus with sibling validation work in /Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/superfunctions-dev; reuse_rule=safe for similar Nucleus migration QA or browser-bridge diagnosis in these linked checkouts, but re-check the exact dev host, auth state, backend health, and current migration diff before reusing as proof of current correctness.\\n4941-\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a022fa-bdb6-76a2-ae8a-55c7d75217ca","create_time":1787293273.722439}}}
